%% Disputes and returns flow
%% Status: current | Related: apps/api/src/services/disputes.service.js
flowchart TD
  Recv[Receiving identifies issue] --> Open[POST /api/disputes\nlinked to customer_order]
  Open --> Review[Supplier / restaurant review states]
  Review --> Resolve{resolution type}
  Resolve -->|credit_note| CN[Create credit_note\nlinked to invoice if present]
  Resolve -->|replacement| Rep[createReplacementOrderFromDispute\nPLACED new order]
  Resolve -->|other| Close[Close dispute status]
  Orig[Original order] --> Stays[Stays received/partial — not re-opened]
  Rep --> NewCycle[New fulfillment cycle for replacement order]
  Feature[disputes_returns plan feature] -.-> Open
